    {
      "name": "2. Consultar por GraphQL",
      "description": "As duas queries do servico, mais os casos de borda.\n\nPublique os eventos da pasta 1 antes, senao as respostas vem vazias.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. patientHistory — estado atual de cada consulta",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('sem erros GraphQL', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().errors, 'errors').to.be.undefined;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('uma entrada por consulta, com o estado mais recente', function () {",
                  "    const rows = pm.response.json().data.patientHistory;",
                  "    const alvo = pm.variables.get('appointmentId');",
                  "    const c = rows.filter(r => r.appointmentId === alvo);",
                  "    pm.expect(c.length, `esperava 1 linha para a consulta ${alvo} — publique os eventos 1-3 primeiro`).to.eql(1);",
                  "    pm.expect(c[0].eventStatus).to.eql('COMPLETED');",
                  "    pm.expect(c[0].appointmentDate, 'deveria mostrar a data remarcada').to.eql('2026-09-12T14:00:00');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "{\n  patientHistory(patientId: 10) {\n    appointmentId\n    eventStatus\n    appointmentDate\n    doctorName\n  }\n}",
                "variables": ""
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/graphql",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "graphql"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Colapsa a trilha: UMA entrada por consulta, com o evento mais recente.\n\nDepois dos eventos 1-3, a consulta {{appointmentId}} aparece como COMPLETED com a data remarcada (12/09) — a data original nao aparece aqui, so no appointmentTimeline."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. appointmentTimeline — trilha completa",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('a trilha esta em ordem cronologica', function () {",
                  "    const t = pm.response.json().data.appointmentTimeline;",
                  "    pm.expect(t.length, 'publique os eventos 1-3 primeiro').to.eql(3);",
                  "    pm.expect(t.map(e => e.eventStatus))",
                  "        .to.eql(['SCHEDULED', 'RESCHEDULED', 'COMPLETED']);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('a data original sobrevive a remarcacao', function () {",
                  "    const t = pm.response.json().data.appointmentTimeline;",
                  "    pm.expect(t[0].appointmentDate, 'data original perdida').to.eql('2026-09-05T09:00:00');",
                  "    pm.expect(t[1].appointmentDate).to.eql('2026-09-12T14:00:00');",
                  "    pm.expect(t[2].appointmentDate).to.eql('2026-09-12T14:00:00');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "{\n  appointmentTimeline(appointmentId: 42) {\n    eventStatus\n    appointmentDate\n    occurredAt\n  }\n}",
                "variables": ""
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/graphql",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "graphql"
              ]
            },
            "description": "A historia inteira da consulta, em ordem cronologica.\n\nE aqui que o append-only aparece: a data ORIGINAL (05/09) continua na primeira linha, mesmo depois da remarcacao para 12/09. Uma tabela de estado teria perdido essa informacao."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. patientHistory — todos os campos disponiveis",
